    "chunk_text": "mid wige acwealde \u00f0one cyning & Fram Lebna he ferde mid his fyrde to Lachis. & Drihten him sealde on \u00f0one o\u00f0erne d\u00e6g \u00f0a buruh on his handa & \u00f0a buruhwara samod, & he He ferde \u00f0a to Eglon, & ymbs\u00e6t \u00f0a buruh. & on \u00f0am ylcan d\u00e6ge he geeode \u00f0a burh, & mid w\u00e6pnum acwealde \u00f0a \u00f0e wunedon on hyre. Fram Eglon hi ferdon & fuhton on Ebron, & \u00f0a buruh oferwunnon, & mid wige acwealdon eal \u00f0\u00e6t Fram Hebron he gecyrde to Dabira \u00f0\u00e6re byrig & hi aweste, & oferwan \u00f0one cyningc & his folc Iosue ofsloh \u00f0a mid \u00f0am sigef\u00e6stan here eall \u00f0\u00e6t mennisc \u00f0e on muntum wunode, & \u00f0a \u00f0e on \u00f0am On anre hergunge he aweste fram Chadesbarne, o\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t he com to Gazan, eal Gessen land o\u00f0 & hi ealle gecyrdon gesunde to Galgala. \u00d0IS wear\u00f0 \u00f0a gecydd \u00f0am cyninge Iabin, \u00f0e rixode on Asor, & he hra\u00f0e sende to eallum \u00f0am & hi anmodlice comon ealle mid heora folcum, swa m\u00e6nigfealde swa swa sandceosel on s\u00e6strande Ac Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Iosue: Ne ondr\u00e6d \u00f0u \u00f0e \u00f0as m\u00e6niu; nu to mergen ic hi sylle on \u00f0isre ylcan tide Iosue com \u00f0a mid gecampe to him mid eallum his here, & hi hetelice sloh, & nan \u00f0ing ne bel\u00e6fde He forcearf \u00f0a hohsina ealra \u00f0\u00e6ra horsa & forb\u00e6rnde heora",
